  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n12m = 18n = 21p\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n12m = 18n = 21p = 1 \n\n⇒ m = 1/12, n = 1/18, p = 1/21\n\nm : n : p = (1/12 : 1/18 : 1/21)\n\nLCM of (12, 18, 21) = 252\n\nm : n : p = (1/12 : 1/18 : 1/21) × 252 = 21 : 14 : 12\n\n**∴ The ratio of m : n : p is 21 : 14 : 12**",
